[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MachineSpecies" format=3]
; The Chorister (SleeperBehavior): a Votary of the frozen choir, asleep on its knees mid-prayer, bowed under
; its rime. Footsteps never wake it; a hard landing close by does: it straightens, the rime falling from it,
; its eye goes the hazard color, and it walks slowly after the noise and whoever made it, striking with
; the Votary's blade after the same wind-up. Left alone a while, it kneels and sleeps again.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/machines/MachineSpecies.cs" id="1_species"]
